          <span class="fc-indicator state-NOT_OBSERVED">Qatar/Oman hosts senior-level bilateral session after Nov 3 (+20pp)</span>
          <span class="fc-indicator state-NOT_OBSERVED">Brent crude sustained above $160 for 10+ days (+10pp)</span>
