      <p class="scenario-line"><strong class="label-prot">Protracted path (62%):</strong> The modal outcome, consistent with NOT(F2)=0.86 and NOT(F6)=0.93 — no diplomatic session, no framework agreement, ongoing IRGC maritime operations, and Trump's explicit pre-midterm restraint framing holding through November 3.</p>
      <p class="scenario-line"><strong class="label-desc">De-escalation path (11%):</strong> Contingent on F2 firing (p=0.14): Qatar/Oman mediating a convened session and Rubio walking back the delegation expulsion — both NOT_OBSERVED and structurally unlikely within the current 14-day window.</p>
